Subject: [PATCH] Add GA4, Search Console, and IndexNow for busselect.jp

- Inject GA4 via layout head using NEXT_PUBLIC env vars
- Add IndexNow key file and GitHub Action
- Document DNS and env setup for OpenAI/vinext hosting
---
